          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p><b>Question 2 (0.25 points)</b></p><p><b>2. (0.25 mark)</b> Modify/replace the data for the resource. Copy the content of the <b>courses.json</b> file.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p><b>Câu 2 (0.25 điểm)</b></p><p><b>2. (0.25 điểm)</b> Sửa/thay thế dữ liệu cho resource. Chép nội dung của file <b>courses.json</b> vào.</p></div>",
          "sampleSolution": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Replace the resource data with the courses.json content. Keep field names identical to the schema so the app can read them directly.</p><pre><code>// courses.json — dán vào tab &quot;Data&quot; của resource (hoặc POST từng bản ghi)\n[\n  {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;1&quot;,\n    &quot;courseName&quot;: &quot;REACT NATIVE&quot;,\n    &quot;courseImage&quot;: &quot;https://picsum.photos/id/1/300/200&quot;,\n    &quot;percentLearning&quot;: 100,\n    &quot;isCompleted&quot;: true,\n    &quot;courseType&quot;: &quot;Web/Design&quot;\n  },\n  {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;2&quot;,\n    &quot;courseName&quot;: &quot;DATA SCIENCE&quot;,\n    &quot;courseImage&quot;: &quot;https://picsum.photos/id/2/300/200&quot;,\n    &quot;percentLearning&quot;: 40,\n    &quot;isCompleted&quot;: false,\n    &quot;courseType&quot;: &quot;Data Science&quot;\n  },\n  {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;3&quot;,\n    &quot;courseName&quot;: &quot;WEB SECURITY&quot;,\n    &quot;courseImage&quot;: &quot;https://picsum.photos/id/3/300/200&quot;,\n    &quot;percentLearning&quot;: 100,\n    &quot;isCompleted&quot;: true,\n    &quot;courseType&quot;: &quot;Security&quot;\n  },\n  {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;4&quot;,\n    &quot;courseName&quot;: &quot;NODE JS&quot;,\n    &quot;courseImage&quot;: &quot;https://picsum.photos/id/4/300/200&quot;,\n    &quot;percentLearning&quot;: 75,\n    &quot;isCompleted&quot;: false,\n    &quot;courseType&quot;: &quot;Web/Design&quot;\n  }\n]</code></pre></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Thay dữ liệu resource bằng nội dung courses.json. Giữ tên field trùng khớp schema để app đọc được ngay.</p><pre><code>// courses.json — dán vào tab &quot;Data&quot; của resource (hoặc POST từng bản ghi)\n[\n  {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;1&quot;,\n    &quot;courseName&quot;: &quot;REACT NATIVE&quot;,\n    &quot;courseImage&quot;: &quot;https://picsum.photos/id/1/300/200&quot;,\n    &quot;percentLearning&quot;: 100,\n    &quot;isCompleted&quot;: true,\n    &quot;courseType&quot;: &quot;Web/Design&quot;\n  },\n  {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;2&quot;,\n    &quot;courseName&quot;: &quot;DATA SCIENCE&quot;,\n    &quot;courseImage&quot;: &quot;https://picsum.photos/id/2/300/200&quot;,\n    &quot;percentLearning&quot;: 40,\n    &quot;isCompleted&quot;: false,\n    &quot;courseType&quot;: &quot;Data Science&quot;\n  },\n  {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;3&quot;,\n    &quot;courseName&quot;: &quot;WEB SECURITY&quot;,\n    &quot;courseImage&quot;: &quot;https://picsum.photos/id/3/300/200&quot;,\n    &quot;percentLearning&quot;: 100,\n    &quot;isCompleted&quot;: true,\n    &quot;courseType&quot;: &quot;Security&quot;\n  },\n  {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;4&quot;,\n    &quot;courseName&quot;: &quot;NODE JS&quot;,\n    &quot;courseImage&quot;: &quot;https://picsum.photos/id/4/300/200&quot;,\n    &quot;percentLearning&quot;: 75,\n    &quot;isCompleted&quot;: false,\n    &quot;courseType&quot;: &quot;Web/Design&quot;\n  }\n]</code></pre></div>",
